      "settings": {
        "heading": "Bodology for Fertility:\nThe Studies",
        "subtext": "Ovulation is metabolic. High insulin pushes the ovaries toward androgen production and disrupts the signals that mature and release an egg. That's why an insulin-sensitizing molecule became one of the most-studied supplements for ovulatory function. Four studies, laid out straight.*",
        "bg_color": "#F2EEEA",
        "text_color": "#1A2874",
        "divider_color": "#3447AF"
      }
    },
